WEBVTT

00:00:00.507 --> 00:00:02.572
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Am I</b> in class 2?

00:00:05.869 --> 00:00:07.290
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>you are</b>.

00:00:09.754 --> 00:00:11.160
No, <b>you aren’t</b>.

00:00:14.312 --> 00:00:15.727
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Are you</b> Mike?

00:00:18.924 --> 00:00:20.394
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>I am</b>.

00:00:22.879 --> 00:00:24.352
No, <b>I’m not</b>.